          <div class="comment__body break-text text-flow"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">I think you are misunderstanding it. Each validation fold is always a separate holdout dataset, so when you evaluate your model on it, you are not training on it. Why would it be a problem training on that fold for another validation holdout.</p>
